% ADJ52 case-22 program (this patient's observations + queries only; no rules).
% 61-year-old man, recently retired, referred to ENT after ~5 months of steadily
% worsening BILATERAL nasal obstruction and bilateral hearing reduction with
% intermittent aural fullness; otherwise well (no B-symptoms: no fever, no night
% sweats, no weight loss; no epistaxis, no dysphagia). Exam: enlarged inferior
% turbinates, BILATERAL middle-ear effusions, and a smooth soft fleshy mass filling
% the ROOF of the nasopharynx. Audiometry: bilateral CONDUCTIVE hearing loss
% (48 dB R / 52 dB L). Bloods: mild anaemia (Hb 9.9), mild leucocytosis, normal
% LDH/ESR/albumin. Blood film + immunophenotyping: a SMALL (~8%) CLONAL B-cell
% population with a distinctive surface marker profile. Nasopharyngeal biopsy:
% architecture EFFACED by a MONOTONOUS population of small mature lymphocytes with
% coarse clumped chromatin and scattered pale PROLIFERATION CENTRES. IHC: CD20+
% diffuse, CD5+, CD23 variably+, BCL2+, CD3-, CD10-, cyclin D1 NEGATIVE.
% Targeted molecular work undertaken on the clonal cells — results PENDING.

% --- immunophenotype (the clonal CD5+ B-cell gestalt) ---
observe ihc(cd20_positive_diffuse)
observe ihc(cd5_positive)
observe ihc(cd23_positive_variable)
observe ihc(bcl2_positive)
observe ihc(cd3_negative)
observe ihc(cd10_negative)
observe ihc(cyclin_d1_negative)

% --- circulating clonal compartment ---
observe finding(clonal_b_cell_population_small_circulating)
observe finding(distinctive_surface_marker_profile)

% --- histology ---
observe histology(architecture_effacement_monotonous)
observe histology(monotonous_small_lymphocytes_clumped_chromatin)
observe histology(proliferation_centres_present)

% --- clinical / ENT presentation (nasopharyngeal mass -> Eustachian obstruction) ---
observe exam_finding(nasopharyngeal_mass)
observe exam_finding(bilateral_middle_ear_effusion)
observe audiometry_result(bilateral_conductive_hearing_loss)
observe mass_location(nasopharynx_roof)

% NOT observed (open, decision-relevant, u1): molecular_t1114(...) and ighv_status(...)

% --- queries: each candidate diagnosis + the recommended next step ---
? diagnosis(chronic_lymphocytic_leukemia_small_lymphocytic_lymphoma)
? diagnosis(mantle_cell_lymphoma)
? diagnosis(marginal_zone_lymphoma)
? diagnosis(follicular_lymphoma)
? diagnosis(reactive_lymphoid_hyperplasia)
? next_step(cll_fish_ighv_tp53_and_t1114_exclusion_panel)
